    <profile name="TONGUE LASH" id="24de-0216-0e14-f689" hidden="false" typeId="39ba-3647-6510-7709" typeName="Ability">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Power Cost" typeId="1bf9-e90f-6415-1697">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="4502-0f40-9d79-bc93">During the model’s Turn.</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b9cf-1e25-5292-ae34">Make a Ranged attack as follows: Range 9”, 2D8. Cannot target LARGE models.
Any model hit by the attack is not wounded but is moved directly (the shortest route) into base contact with the Dambuster’s front arc and marked as Fatigued. The model’s front arc and base should be in contarct with the Dambuster’s base. Models that were Knocked-down remain so. If it is not possible to move the model, the attack has no effect.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
